# 统一换行符：仓库里一律 LF，检出时也不要自动转成 CRLF
# （否则 Windows 上克隆下来满屏 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，
#   而且跨平台协作时 diff 会失真）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 批处理必须 CRLF，某些老 cmd 解析器对 LF 的 .bat 会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：别做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 这些文件 diff 没意义
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
